# DOI & SOP Drawings Placeholder

This directory is for the extracted contents of "DOI & SOP.zip" from the aviator drawing folder on Google Drive.

To populate this directory:
1. Download DOI_SOP.zip from: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16QUsfsiZc2MhCyFMrdyHYLA_huW8bX61
2. Extract it here: unzip /path/to/DOI_SOP.zip -d .
3. Commit the extracted files

See ../README.md for more details.
